        <idPurp>This feature represents all of the active Rail Routes in Minnesota.</idPurp>
        <idAbs>&lt;span style='font-family:&amp;quot;Avenir Next W01&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next W00&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next&amp;quot;, Avenir, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'&gt;This dataset represents all of the active railroad routes within Minnesota (meaning not abandoned or tracks removed). These routes have been split into representative segments based on rail crossing locations and attributes are loaded into this dataset monthly. The symbology of this feature includes unique value color coding of the primary operating railroad where the &amp;quot;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face='Avenir Next W01, Avenir Next W00, Avenir Next, Avenir, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif' style='font-family:&amp;quot;Avenir Next W01&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next W00&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next&amp;quot;, Avenir, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'&gt;ubsidiary railroads&amp;quot; have been grouped together with their &amp;quot;parent railroad&amp;quot; (i.e. Soo Line Railroad = Canadian Pacific Railroad). The routes are also symbolized using&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:&amp;quot;Avenir Next W01&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next W00&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next&amp;quot;, Avenir, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'&gt; line width as a function of total trains per day (as reported by the primary operating railroad).  This is a planning level dataset and the coordinate system used is NAD83 UTM Zone 15N.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style='font-family:&amp;quot;Avenir Next W01&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next W00&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Avenir Next&amp;quot;, Avenir, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-family:inherit;'&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-family:inherit;'&gt;For further information please contact Cam Zhen (cameron.zhen@state.mn.us, 651.366.3644) at the Office of Freight &amp;amp; Commercial Vehicle Operations, MnDOT. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</idAbs>
        <idCredit>Office of Freight &amp; Commercial Vehicle Operations - Rail Safety &amp; Coordination Unit, Minnesota Department of Transportation (MnDOT)</idCredit>
